"wa <a href=\"%(mahitaji_url)s\">Mahitaji</a> unakuonyesha hasa unachohitaji."
msgstr ""
"Yes, as the internet source. You'll add a small MikroTik router behind it, "
"which shows customers the payment page. The <a "
"href=\"%(mahitaji_url)s\">Requirements</a> page shows exactly what you need."

#: pages/templates/pages/home.html:168
msgid "Sijui mambo ya kompyuta. Nitaweza?"
msgstr "I'm not good with computers. Can I do it?"

#: pages/templates/pages/home.html:169
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Ndiyo. Unabandika mstari mmoja tu ukifuata <a "
"href=\"%(mwongozo_url)s\">mwongozo wetu</a>. Ukikwama, tunakusaidia."
msgstr ""
"Yes. You paste a single line by following <a href=\"%(mwongozo_url)s\">our "
"guide</a>. If you get stuck, we help you."

#: pages/templates/pages/home.html:172
msgid "Pesa za wateja zinanifikiaje?"
msgstr "How does customers' money reach me?"

#: pages/templates/pages/home.html:173
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Wateja wanalipa kwa simu, na kila mauzo yanaongezwa kwenye salio lako. "
"Unaliona kwenye dashboard, na unatoa pesa kwenda namba yako ya simu wakati "
"wowote unaotaka. Ada ya mwezi (Tsh %(fee)s) inakatwa yenyewe kutoka kwenye "
"salio hilo."
msgstr ""
"Customers pay by phone and every sale is added to your balance. You see it "
"on your dashboard and withdraw to your phone number whenever you like. The "
"monthly fee (Tsh %(fee)s) is deducted from that balance automatically."

#: pages/templates/pages/home.html:176
msgid "Nisipolipa ada ya mwezi itakuwaje?"
msgstr "What happens if I don't pay the monthly fee?"

#: pages/templates/pages/home.html:177
msgid ""
"Mauzo mapya yanasimama hadi ada ilipwe. Wateja waliokwisha kununua vifurushi"
" wanaendelea kutumia hadi muda wao uishe. Salio likitosha, ada inalipwa "
"yenyewe."
msgstr ""
"New sales pause until the fee is paid. Customers who already bought packages"
" keep browsing until their time runs out. If your balance is enough, the fee"
" pays itself."

#: pages/templates/pages/home.html:180
msgid "Internet ikikatika au umeme ukikatika?"
msgstr "What if the internet or power goes out?"

#: pages/templates/pages/home.html:181
msgid ""
"Router ikiwaka tena, inajiunganisha yenyewe. Vocha za wateja hazipotei, na "
"muda wao unaendelea kama ulivyokuwa."
msgstr ""
"When the router comes back on, it reconnects by itself. Customers' vouchers "
"aren't lost and their time carries on."

#: pages/templates/pages/home.html:184
msgid "Nina maeneo mengi ya WiFi. Je, ninahitaji akaunti nyingi?"
msgstr "I have several WiFi spots. Do I need several accounts?"

#: pages/templates/pages/home.html:185
msgid "Hapana. Akaunti moja inasimamia routers zako zote."
msgstr "No. One account manages all your routers."

#: pages/templates/pages/home.html:194
msgid "WiFi yako iko tayari kukuletea pesa."
msgstr "Your WiFi is ready to make you money."

#: pages/templates/pages/home.html:195
msgid "Fungua akaunti kwa dakika moja. Hakuna kadi, hakuna mkataba."
msgstr "Open an account in a minute. No card, no contract."

#: pages/templates/pages/home.html:199
